## Editing Files Externally

Obsidian caches open files in memory and reverts external changes. For bulk edits:

```bash
osascript -e 'quit app "Obsidian"' && sleep 2
rm -f ".obsidian/workspace.json" ".obsidian/workspace-mobile.json"
# ... make edits ...
open -a Obsidian
```

